+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
+/*
+ * ASUS Tinker Edge R - default configuration:
+ *   HDMI-RX (Geekworm X1301, TC358743) on the CSI0 connector, CSI1 idle.
